#: src/practice/mode-explainer.tsx:49
msgid "Fluent note reading is a visual-perceptual skill. Nothing here is on a clock, so you can look until a note’s whole pattern lands instead of counting lines up to it. Miss one and it comes back a few questions later. Notes reach Recognized this way; Fluent is Speed’s to give."
msgstr "Fluent note reading is a visual-perceptual skill. Nothing here is on a clock, so you can look until a note’s whole pattern lands instead of counting lines up to it. Miss one and it comes back a few questions later. Notes reach Recognized this way; Fluent is Speed’s to give."

#: src/practice/mode-explainer.tsx:52
